  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Among hundred, thousand, and myriad beast kings, myriad beast king sits at the top of that three-step ladder. The lightning crown wolf behind the wolf tide is a myriad beast king; every lightning crown wolf rules at least ten thousand lightning wolves. Facing one head on requires clan elders and the clan leader working together.",
      "chapters": [
        114
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Even with Stealth Scales Gu, Fang Yuan can move among the ordinary wolf tide, yet before a myriad beast king lightning crown wolf he has nowhere to hide, because Lightning Eye Gu in its eyes sees through cloaking.",
      "chapters": [
        127
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_stealth_scales_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "gu_lightning_eye_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A full wolf nest holds three myriad beast king level thunder crown wolves among its hundred and thousand beast king wolves.",
      "chapters": [
        130
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the decisive wolf assault reaches Gu Yue village, Fang Yuan sees the rearmost lightning wolf as large as a small hill and names it myriad beast king Thunder Crown Wolf. Its arrival marks the fight for the village’s survival, and elders with the clan leader charge out toward it.",
